# codebase-memory-mcp index scope (gitignore syntax; its README "discover" section, docs/cbmignore.md).
# Vendored and generated trees are not project code (CLAUDE.md: sandbox-kit/, .claude/, graft/ are vendored). On the
# whole-tree index the graph was 379 MB; with this file 91 MB (re-indexed 2026-09-25, 21 s). The hook's 2 s was NOT the
# index: every `codebase-memory-mcp` hook or CLI call reads its whole 293 MB executable first (4,476 preads, ~2.6 s,
# strace 2026-09-25) before ~40 ms of real work, over the hook's 2,000 ms deadline (AF-AP-220).
/sandbox-kit/
/.claude/
/.agents/
/vendor/
/graft/
/.gitnexus/
/.code-review-graph/
/transcripts/
/docs/archive/
